summary:
  A lapsed order is refused but not taken down.

history:
  Refused and left standing, the order is replayed at the next flicker of
  the network, which is issue #13 arriving by another door.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          Qt.callLater(function() { if (!root._wantsPlaying) stopWithFade(); });

replace:
          Qt.callLater(function() { if (!root._wantsPlaying) void 0; });

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_order_lapsing_is_torn_down_like_a_stop.
  Line-neutral.
